      "text": "It is tru--ly meet__ to__ call thee bless----ed,__ the The--o-to----kos, the ev-er-bless----ed__ and all-im-mac--u--late__ and___ Moth--er of our__ God.__ More hon--’ra-ble____ than the__ Cher--u---bim,____ and be-yond__ com--pare more__ glo--ri-ous than__ the Ser-a--phim,___ who with-out cor-rup----tion____ gav-est birth__ to___ God____ the____ Word, the ver--y The-o--to---kos,__ thee do__ we mag--ni--fy._____________ \n\n___________"
